            description = PPM: Sat80 thresholds passed by ADC[n-2.5] / ADC[n-1.5]. - <a href="https://codimd.web.cern.ch/s/678H65Tk9#PpmTrexInputsdetailppm_1d_tt_adc_HLCase">Help</a>
